\details{
The filter of the RIV data for Definite GPA/MPA are based on the following filter
\itemize{
\item SVV (IC) = Anti-GBM disease – ORPHA:375
\item AND diagnosis confidence = definite
\item SVV != GPA / MPA / EGPA / ANCA vasculitis unclassified
\item AND SVV (IC) != IgA, cryo
\item AND Secondary vasculitis != Yes
\item AND 'Medium vessel' != 1 or 2
\item AND 'large vessel' != 1 or 2
\item AND 'variable vessel' != 1 or 2
}

